    kind: invariant  # 503b
    title: "rust: a function declared in an extern block is not a symbol, so a call to it stays unresolved and matches a catalogue row by short name -- loro's wasm_bindgen Date.now() is reported as std::time::Instant.now"  # 503b
    status: violated  # 503b
    priority: 3  # 503b
    parent:  # 503b
